    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01269",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "突然一条黑色瘦狗朝着他吠起来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Suddenly a thin black dog began barking at him.",
          "g": "predicate"
